SUMMARY:Chhath Puja
LOCATION:Yamuna ghats\, Palla to Okhla\; plus parks and ponds citywide
DESCRIPTION:Fri 13 Nov – Mon 16 Nov 2026\n\nFamilies gather at the water
  at sunset with bamboo baskets of fruit and thekua. A priest leads\, drum
 s and Bhojpuri folk songs run through it\, and the offerings go up as the
  sun goes down — then everyone waits for sunrise to do it again.\n\nSou
 rce: https://indiago.app/en/delhi/festivals/
